[8] base

other attached packages:
[1] gridExtra_0.8 reshape2_1.1  ggplot2_0.8.9 proto_0.3-9.1 reshape_0.8.4
[6] plyr_1.4.1

loaded via a namespace (and not attached):
[1] digest_0.4.2 stringr_0.4  tools_2.13.2

How can I improve the resolution of the wmf plots? Please, consider that
raster images are not what I need, since I want to ungroup them in
Powerpoint. I know that I can do something similar with Inkscape, but I
want to know if it is possible in Powerpoint.

Best regards,

Alan

