Hi Alan,

The border looks fine to me, though the blue line is weird.  I do not
believe there is any other way to get graphics from R into PowerPoint
in a format that will allow you to use PP as a graphics editor.  What
do you need to do?  If you just want to fuss with titles, axis labels,
etc.  you could produce just the bare plot in ggplot2 and leave the
labels etc. for PP.

Cheers,

Josh

