It's much more simple than what you've done. A very good attempt though.

ggplot(df,aes(date, elev, group = floor_date(date, "1 week")))+
geom_boxplot(outlier.size = 2, outlier.colour = "darkgrey", outlier.shape = 1) +
scale_x_date(format = "%b")+
labs(x = "Date", y = "Reservoir Elevation (m)")+
geom_line(aes(colour=as.factor(year), group=year))

