MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

?scale_size()

ggplot(data, aes(x=x,y=y)) +
geom_point(aes(size=l))+
scale_size(to=c(5,15))

HTH,

Brandon

