Cleveland (1984) did some research into how well we could interpret various visual properties. Color is at the bottom of the list. There's a nice diagram of it here:
http://processtrends.com/TOC_data_visualization.htm

Zack, I'd suggest binning the data yourself and then graphing the binned data.

-Winston

