>> The upper whisker goes to the largest x that's less than or equal to Q3 +
>> 1.5 * IQR. It won't actually go to Q3 + 1.5 * IQR unless there's a data
>> point right there, even if there are outliers. The lower whisker is similar.
>>
>> -Winston

